I\'m Galib,Biginner product designer based in Jsshore\",\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d939f1d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"922dc50\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-2daf572 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\\\" data-id=\\\"2daf572\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"text-editor.default\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n<p>I\\u2019ve worked with teams of all sizes, from agencies to solo projects. No matter the scale, I bring clarity, structure, and a passion for human-centered design.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-f50552c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\\\" data-id=\\\"f50552c\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"text-editor.default\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n<p>Over the years, I\\u2019ve developed skills that span product strategy, research, and visual design. I lead with empathy and back decisions with data when needed. I\\u2019ve helped shape product roadmaps, mentor junior designers, and build design systems from scratch. Each project is a new opportunity to grow, innovate, and design something that matters.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\",\"text_color\":\"#B4C0DB\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"aa82864\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0182a3e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/portfolio01\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/11\\/boy_portrait_electric_blue_ice_white.png\",\"id\":48,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"A boy\",\"source\":\"library\"}