(8, 1, '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://localhost/portfolio01.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '', 3, 'http://localhost/portfolio01/?p=8', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(9, 1, '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Sample Page', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '2026-11-12 11:11:01', '', 2, 'http://localhost/portfolio01/?p=9', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(10, 1, '2026-11-12 11:12:38', '2026-11-12 11:12:38', '<a href=\"#\">\n									HELLO I\'M GALIB\n					</a>\n									<h2>A beginner designer...Who recently started his journey on the path of web devloopment.</h2>							<ul>\n							<li>\n										galib1234@gmail.com\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										017******85\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M505.04 442.66l-99.71-99.69c-4.5-4.5-10.6-7-17-7h-16.3c27.6-35.3 44-79.69 44-127.99C416.03 93.09 322.92 0 208.02 0S0 93.09 0 207.98s93.11 207.98 208.02 207.98c48.3 0 92.71-16.4 128.01-44v16.3c0 6.4 2.5 12.5 7 17l99.71 99.69c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l28.3-28.3c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.59.1-33.99zm-297.02-90.7c-79.54 0-144-64.34-144-143.98 0-79.53 64.35-143.98 144-143.98 79.54 0 144 64.34 144 143.98 0 79.53-64.35 143.98-144 143.98zm.02-239.96c-40.78 0-73.84 33.05-73.84 73.83 0 32.96 48.26 93.05 66.75 114.86a9.24 9.24 0 0 0 14.18 0c18.49-21.81 66.75-81.89 66.75-114.86 0-40.78-33.06-73.83-73.84-73.83zm0 96c-13.26 0-24-10.75-24-24 0-13.26 10.75-24 24-24s24 10.74 24 24c0 13.25-10.75 24-24 24z\"></path></svg>						\n										Jashore,Bangladesh\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n																	<img width=\"1024\" height=\"816\" src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/boy_portrait_electric_blue_ice_white.png\" alt=\"A boy\" />													<p>I\'m a passionate beginner web designer who enjoys creating modern, clean, and user-friendly websites. I\'m currently learning HTML, CSS, and JavaScript while exploring new design ideas and improving my skills. My goal is to turn creative ideas into beautiful, functional web experiences and grow into a professional web developer.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Download CV\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n									VIew fortfolio\n					</a>\n									<h2>Connect with me:</h2>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>			\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M389.2 48h70.6L305.6 224.2 487 464H345L233.7 318.6 106.5 464H35.8L200.7 275.5 26.8 48H172.4L272.9 180.9 389.2 48zM364.4 421.8h39.1L151.1 88h-42L364.4 421.8z\"></path></svg>			\n												<a href=\"#\">\n									What I do\n					</a>\n									<h2>Programs which make you feel alive</h2>							\n							<h2>UI/UX Design</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"0853d4b\">Crafting intuitive interfaces to improve user experience.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Design Systems</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"615613e\">I build scalable and consistent design systems that streamline development, maintain brand consistency, and enhance collaboration between teams.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Wirefarming &amp; Portotyping</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"89d7ac1\">I turn early ideas into structured wireframes and interactive prototypes to test functionality and user experience before full-scale development.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M564 224c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-72c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-72c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v12h-88v-24h12c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12V44c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-72c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v12H96V44c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H12C5.373 32 0 37.373 0 44v72c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h12v160H12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v72c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h72c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-12h88v24h-12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v72c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h72c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-12h224v12c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h72c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-72c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-12V224h12zM352 64h32v32h-32V64zm0 256h32v32h-32v-32zM64 352H32v-32h32v32zm0-256H32V64h32v32zm32 216v-12c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H72V128h12c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-12h224v12c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h12v160h-12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v12H96zm128 136h-32v-32h32v32zm280-64h-12c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v12H256v-12c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-12v-24h88v12c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h72c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12v-72c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-12v-88h88v12c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h12v160zm40 64h-32v-32h32v32zm0-256h-32v-32h32v32z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h2>User Research</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"5cffe3a\">Gathering insights to design solutions based on real user needs.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Mobile App Design</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"864074e\">Designing responsive mobile apps that feel natural and engaging.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Web App design</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"5ae7af4\">Creating functional, responsive web apps for all screen sizes.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>					<h2>Curious What Else I Do</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"6555c02\">Take a closer look at my complete design skillset. You might find your perfect match.</p>\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Click here\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n									ABOUT ME\n					</a>\n									<h1>Designing products with purpose and clarity.</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n									<h2>I\'m Galib,Biginner product designer based in Jsshore</h2>		<p>I’ve worked with teams of all sizes, from agencies to solo projects. No matter the scale, I bring clarity, structure, and a passion for human-centered design.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Over the years, I’ve developed skills that span product strategy, research, and visual design. I lead with empathy and back decisions with data when needed. I’ve helped shape product roadmaps, mentor junior designers, and build design systems from scratch. Each project is a new opportunity to grow, innovate, and design something that matters.</p>													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"816\" src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/boy_portrait_electric_blue_ice_white.png\" alt=\"A boy\" />																<h2>Work experiences</h2>		<p>I’ve spent over 6 years designing products for startups, SaaS companies, and enterprise clients. From creating MVPs to building design systems.</p>					\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"icon1_grad_v2\" x1=\"32\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"54\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FF2A1A\"></stop><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#FF7B1C\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#F7E425\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M32 11C21.5066 11 13 19.5066 13 30V50.5C13 52.433 14.567 54 16.5 54C18.433 54 20 52.433 20 50.5V30C20 23.3726 25.3726 18 32 18C38.6274 18 44 23.3726 44 30V39.5L35.2 31.8C33.7 30.5 31.4 30.7 30.1 32.2C28.8 33.7 29 36 30.5 37.3L45.2 50.2C47.4 52.1 51 50.6 51 47.6V30C51 19.5066 42.4934 11 32 11Z\" fill=\"url(#icon1_grad_v2)\"></path><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"27.5\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"url(#icon1_grad_v2)\"></circle></svg>			\n							<h3>StudioFlux Creative</h3>					<h5>Sr. Product Designer</h5>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Mar 2024 – Present\n					</a>\n<hr data-interaction-id=\"dc650bf\" />\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><polygon points=\"31,10 14,20 31,30\" fill=\"#0B33A8\"></polygon><polygon points=\"33,10 50,20 33,30\" fill=\"#0B33A8\"></polygon><polygon points=\"13,21.5 13,42.5 29.5,32\" fill=\"#1C75BC\"></polygon><polygon points=\"51,21.5 51,42.5 34.5,32\" fill=\"#1C75BC\"></polygon><polygon points=\"14,44 31,54 31,34\" fill=\"#0B33A8\"></polygon><polygon points=\"50,44 33,54 33,34\" fill=\"#0B33A8\"></polygon></svg>			\n							<h3>Nova Interactive</h3>					<h5>UI/UX Designer</h5>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Mar 2024 – Present\n					</a>\n<hr data-interaction-id=\"1af9dae\" />\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"icon3_grad\" x1=\"32\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"56\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#3698D4\"></stop><stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#75C7E8\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#9BE3C7\"></stop></linearGradient><clipPath id=\"hex_clip\"><polygon points=\"32,14 48,23 48,41 32,50 16,41 16,23\"></polygon></clipPath></defs><polygon points=\"32,9 52,20.5 52,43.5 32,55 12,43.5 12,20.5\" stroke=\"url(#icon3_grad)\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></polygon><g clip-path=\"url(#hex_clip)\"><rect x=\"12\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"44\" fill=\"url(#icon3_grad)\" opacity=\"0.85\"></rect><polygon points=\"10,42 22,28 34,42\" fill=\"#9BE3C7\" stroke=\"#111111\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></polygon><polygon points=\"30,42 42,29 54,42\" fill=\"#9BE3C7\" stroke=\"#111111\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></polygon><polygon points=\"15,48 32,26 49,48\" fill=\"url(#icon3_grad)\" stroke=\"#111111\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></polygon></g></svg>			\n							<h3>PixelForge Agency</h3>					<h5>Visual Designer</h5>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Mar 2024 – Present\n					</a>\n<hr data-interaction-id=\"2c866b3\" />\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><polygon points=\"32,11 50,21.5 50,42.5 32,53 14,42.5 14,21.5\" stroke=\"#14C9B8\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></polygon><polygon points=\"32,18 44,25 44,39 32,46 20,39 20,25\" fill=\"#5582E6\"></polygon><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"21\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#5582E6\" stroke=\"#111111\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"43\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"#5582E6\" stroke=\"#111111\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle></svg>			\n							<h3>PixelForge Agency</h3>					<h5>Jr. UX Designer</h5>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Mar 2024 – Present\n					</a>\n<hr data-interaction-id=\"4631f5f\" />\n					<h3>Tools I used</h3>		<p>I use Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, Sketch, FigJam, and other industry tools to bring ideas to life. Keeping the process smooth across teams.</p>					\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M25 10H32V24H25C21.134 24 18 20.866 18 17C18 13.134 21.134 10 25 10Z\" fill=\"#F24E1E\"></path><path d=\"M32 10H39C42.866 10 46 13.134 46 17C46 20.866 42.866 24 39 24H32V10Z\" fill=\"#FF7262\"></path><path d=\"M25 24H32V38H25C21.134 38 18 34.866 18 31C18 27.134 21.134 24 25 24Z\" fill=\"#A259FF\"></path><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"31\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#1ABCFE\"></circle><path d=\"M25 38H32V45C32 48.866 28.866 52 25 52C21.134 52 18 48.866 18 45C18 41.134 21.134 38 25 38Z\" fill=\"#0ACF83\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Figma						\n					</h3>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><polygon points=\"32,12 20,14 32,26 44,14\" fill=\"#FDB300\"></polygon><polygon points=\"20,14 10,26 20,26\" fill=\"#EA6C00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"44,14 54,26 44,26\" fill=\"#EA6C00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"20,14 20,26 32,26\" fill=\"#FDAD00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"44,14 44,26 32,26\" fill=\"#FDAD00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"32,12 20,14 32,26\" fill=\"#FDD231\"></polygon><polygon points=\"32,12 44,14 32,26\" fill=\"#FDD231\"></polygon><polygon points=\"20,26 44,26 32,52\" fill=\"#FDAD00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"10,26 20,26 32,52\" fill=\"#EA6C00\"></polygon><polygon points=\"54,26 44,26 32,52\" fill=\"#EA6C00\"></polygon></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Sketch						\n					</h3>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#001E36\"></rect><text x=\"32\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#31A8FF\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"-0.5\">Ps</text></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Photoshop						\n					</h3>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"#330000\"></rect><text x=\"32\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#FF9A00\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"-0.5\">Ai</text></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Illustrator						\n					</h3>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#FF3366\"></circle><text x=\"32\" y=\"40\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"Georgia, \'Times New Roman\', serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"27\" text-anchor=\"middle\">in</text></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Invision						\n					</h3>\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle><polygon points=\"22,18 42,18 42,28 32,28\" fill=\"#67DBFF\"></polygon><polygon points=\"22,28 32,28 42,38 22,38\" fill=\"#0099FF\"></polygon><polygon points=\"22,38 32,38 32,48\" fill=\"#0055FF\"></polygon></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Framer						\n					</h3>\n							<h3>Let\'s work together! Send me a message\n</h3>					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n			Days of Exprience			\n				0\n				+\n			Project Completed			\n				0\n				+\n			Client Satisfaction Rate			\n				0\n				+\n			Mentorship Hours			\n				0\n				+\n												<a href=\"#\">\n									I\'ve Worked With\n					</a>\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-10.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-1-3.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg (1)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-2-3.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg (2)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-3-2.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg (3)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-4-1.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg (4)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gemini-svg-5-1.svg\" alt=\"gemini-svg (5)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2