on: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Mobile App Design</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"864074e\">Designing responsive mobile apps that feel natural and engaging.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n							<h2>Web App design</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"5ae7af4\">Creating functional, responsive web apps for all screen sizes.</p>\n					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>					<h2>Curious What Else I Do</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"6555c02\">Take a closer look at my complete design skillset. You might find your perfect match.</p>\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Click here\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n									ABOUT ME\n					</a>\n									<h1>Designing products with purpose and clarity.</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n									<h2>I\'m Galib,Biginner product designer based in Jsshore</h2>		\n<p>I’ve worked with teams of all sizes, from agencies to solo projects. No matter the scale, I bring clarity, structure, and a passion for human-centered design.</p>\n<p>Over the years, I’ve developed skills that span product strategy, research, and visual design. I lead with empathy and back decisions with data when needed. I’ve helped shape product roadmaps, mentor junior designers, and build design systems from scratch. Each project is a new opportunity to grow, innovate, and design something that matters.</p>\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"816\" src=\"http://localhost/portfolio01/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/boy_portrait_electric_blue_ice_white.png\" alt=\"A boy\" />																<h2>Work experiences</h2>		<p>I’ve spent over 6 years designing products for startups, SaaS companies, and enterprise clients. From creating MVPs to building design systems.</p>			<h2>Let\'s work together! Send me a message\n</h2>					<style>\n  .arrow-btn {\n    --accent: #60A5FA;\n    --ring: rgba(96, 165, 250, .45);\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--ring);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: border-color .25s ease, transform .25s ease;\n  }\n  .arrow-btn svg {\n    transform: rotate(-45deg);\n    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible {\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:hover svg,\n  .arrow-btn:focus-visible svg {\n    transform: rotate(0deg);\n  }\n  .arrow-btn:active {\n    transform: scale(.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Open\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\"\n       stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/>\n  </svg>\n</a>							\n			Days of Exprience			\n				0\n				+', 'HOME', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '10-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-22 13:32:28', '2026-11-22 13:32:28', '', 10, 'http://localhost/portfolio01/?p=129', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
